# RouteFlow .claudeignore — keep Claude's context focused on real source.
# Excludes build artefacts, dependencies, generated output, and bulky data.

# ── Dependencies (never read these) ──────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/

# ── Build artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/out/
**/.turbo/
**/.expo/
**/coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Lockfiles & generated (no reasoning value) ───────────────────
package-lock.json
**/migration_lock.toml

# ── Test artefacts / auth storage state ──────────────────────────
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
apps/web/e2e/setup/.auth/

# ── Data dumps & logs ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.sql
*.dump
*.log

# ── OS / editor noise ────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# NOTE: static design dirs (mockups/, routeflow-app/, apps/operator-app-design/)
# are intentionally NOT ignored — they are sometimes edited directly.
